{# ── Our Mission ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col fade-in">
      <div class="two-col__body">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Who We Are</span>
        <h2 style="text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px;">A Mission,<br>Not Just a Business</h2>
        <div class="about-story" style="max-width:none;margin:0;">
          <p class="about-story__lead">We know how stressful, and how expensive, a single ticket or mistake can be, especially once insurance premiums start to climb.</p>
          <p>Our goal is to help drivers, particularly young and new drivers, build safer habits, steer clear of costly violations, and feel more confident behind the wheel.</p>
          <p>We believe education and awareness can protect licenses, reduce insurance risk, and make Virginia's communities safer. That belief shapes every part of our course.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
